sequenceDiagram
  actor User
  participant FE as WeatherPage
  participant API as FastAPI /api/v1
  participant WI as WeatherIntelService
  participant WP as Weather provider
  participant RM as BaselineFloodRiskModel
  participant DB as SQLAlchemy session

  User->>FE: Open /weather
  FE->>API: GET /weather/current
  API->>WI: current()
  WI->>WP: MockWeatherProvider or OpenWeather
  WP-->>WI: WeatherSnapshot
  WI-->>API: snapshot
  API-->>FE: JSON temperature rainfall wind

  FE->>API: GET /risk/flood
  API->>WI: flood()
  WI->>WP: current + rainfall
  WI->>RM: evaluate(FloodRiskInput)
  Note over RM: Weighted formula not a neural net
  WI->>WI: overlay_demo_flood if USE_MOCK_PROVIDERS
  WI-->>API: flood_probability factors
  API-->>FE: JSON 82% when mock overlay on
  FE-->>User: KPI cards and charts
  Note over DB: Live weather path does not require reading WeatherObservation rows; seed still stores sample observations
